ability (56/ penalty avoidance) are prioritized over pure brute-force.  \n*Terminology:*  \n`evaluate_sequence`: \n  - Is fixed. No reprocessing. \n  - Returns score only after LR, ADMM, and bounds checks.  \n*Caveats:*  \nNone of the global variables (like `parent`) should be referenced except `parent` itself, which holds historical bests.",
